Profile: PractitionerRoleIE
Parent: http://hl7.eu/fhir/base/StructureDefinition/practitionerRole-eu-core
Id: practitionerrole-ie
Title: "PractitionerRole (FHIR Core Ireland)"
Description: "Unmodified national constraint of the HL7 Europe Core PractitionerRole profile, reused as-is no Irish-specific
requirement has been identified for this resource in v0.1. Retained as an explicit profile (rather than omitted) so downstream
Irish profiles have a stable national canonical to reference, and so any future national requirement has a clear home."
